# Conn, Gould and Toint, Chapter 4: Basic Linear Algebra

Chapter 4 of [conn2000trust] treats the linear algebra of optimization methods: structured symmetric
systems and the Sherman–Morrison–Woodbury formula (Section 4.1), orthonormal matrices (Section 4.2),
perturbation bounds and direct factorizations of symmetric matrices (Section 4.3), and least-squares
problems, the normal equations, the augmented system and projections onto affine subspaces (Section
4.4).

